.TH QUANUXCTL 1 "October 2025" "QuanuX" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
quanuxctl \- QuanuX Control CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quanuxctl
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The QuanuX Control CLI manages QuanuX developer workflows, bridges, and indicators.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B bridge
Manage SignalR bridge processes (via NATS control plane).
.TP
.B indicators
Probe indicator backend and run quick demos (SMA, etc.).
.SH EXAMPLES
Run a bridge:
.PP
.nf
quanuxctl bridge up --name signalr --runtime flask --port 8077
quanuxctl bridge status --name signalr
quanuxctl bridge down --name signalr
.fi
.PP
Indicators:
.PP
.nf
quanuxctl indicators probe
quanuxctl indicators demo-sma --length 50 --rows 300
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1)
